Here's a simple program in C\# that outputs all numbers from 1 to 100 where instead of outputting every multiple of 5 it gives "moo":


```csharp
using System;

class Program
{
    static void Main(string[] args)
    {
        int i = 1;
        while (i <= 100)
        {
            if (i % 5 == 0)
            {
                Console.WriteLine("moo");
            }
            else
            {
                Console.WriteLine(i);
            }
            i++;
        }
    }
}

```

